{
    "background_story": "Isabela was a warm and vibrant pastry chef who owned a quaint bakery in the heart of the city. She was famous for her delectable bagels, which she lovingly topped with a generous schmeer of cream cheese. Isabela's bakery became a staple in the community, with people lining up every morning to taste her freshly baked goods. But what made her bagels truly special was the love and care she put into each and every one. Isabela would often share stories of her childhood, where her grandmother would schmeer cream cheese on bagels for the family to enjoy on Sundays. As the aroma of freshly baked bagels wafted through the air, Isabela's customers felt like they were part of a warm and welcoming family tradition.",
